KG42.register("clusters-1393b4d9567e120e7e098b7d",{"id":"19-two_stage_battery_sharing::v142-d-CL002","paper":"19-two_stage_battery_sharing","label":"Participation permission, products and transaction organization in community surplus-power sharing","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL002","label":"Participation permission, products and transaction organization in community surplus-power sharing","market_meaning":"Prosumers in the community may participate in local buying and selling; when photovoltaic surplus power exists, it may be shared with or traded to other prosumers and consumers without photovoltaics; the ESC organizes the sharing service, and consumers bear the stated contracting and payment obligations. The product Rule-Chain supplements the aggregate-supply and customer-demand accounting basis after battery operation.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation","bidding","activation"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"The Rule-Chains address the same community sharing mechanism, and their participants, transaction objects and organizational responsibilities are complementary. The conditions of consumers without photovoltaics and of surplus-power availability are retained; the bidding-stage label of R006 is only source traceability of the original Rule-Chain and does not prove the existence of a bidding, order or matching procedure.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"Together, these Rule-Chains answer who may participate, what electrical energy is exchanged and who organizes it, constituting an independent participation and transaction-permission rule. The assembly scope is limited to the stated permissions, product accounting basis and obligations, and does not claim to provide a complete contract or transaction-allocation algorithm.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provide the ESC activity of organizing community P2P exchange and the permission for local buying and selling."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Restrict the electricity-purchase participation identity of consumers without photovoltaics, and retain their contracting and ex-post payment obligations."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Supplement the prosumer's local buying and selling permission in the same transaction arrangement."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Define the shareable electrical energy and the aggregate supply-demand accounting basis, so that the participation permission has a clear transaction object."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g01-e007"],"rationale":"The same community description explicitly permits selling surplus power to consumers without photovoltaics; the consumer Rule-Chain restricts the transaction participants, and the execution Rule-Chain expresses the exchange activity in which they participate."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e007"],"rationale":"The source describes both the prosumer's local buying and selling permission and the community sharing activity; the two Rule-Chains express participation identity and execution scope respectively, and are not two independent transaction mechanisms."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e002","v141-b-g01-e007","v141-b-g02-E19"],"rationale":"The sharing organized by the ESC takes community photovoltaic-battery supply and customer demand as its object, and the product Rule-Chain supplements the meaning of exchangeable electrical energy; the aggregate definition does not constitute a bilateral transaction volume or matching rule."}],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-G004","category":"unverified_source","description":"The participation, product and execution links are supported only by unaudited candidate evidence permitted by the experiment; overlapping source passages do not constitute independent review.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R004","v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C002","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e002","v141-b-g01-e006","v141-b-g01-e007","v141-b-g02-E01","v141-b-g02-E03","v141-b-g02-E19"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check participant conditions, obligations and product definitions; assembled only indicates that a coherent candidate has been formed within the stated limited scope."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G005","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The power quantity in R006-C002 has no local type object in this Rule-Chain, and its C2 request remains unresolved. This expression decomposes the aggregate supply and demand, whereas R005-C004 defines the supply-demand ratio; the two have different uses and cannot be treated as duplicate constraints based on a common source.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E19"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"C should clarify the type, index range and cross-Rule-Chain reference responsibility of the product quantity; the expression-level interface is currently retained, and bid variables or transaction allocation must not be fabricated."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G006","category":"upstream_missing","description":"R004 states only the prosumer's buying and selling permission and does not include the battery-control transfer and contracting obligations in the source; this Rule-Cluster therefore covers only the participation permission that has been given and cannot be regarded as a complete prosumer contract rule.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e005","v141-b-g02-E03"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If complete participation obligations need to be covered, C should supplement the corresponding frozen rules and their control and settlement interfaces; D does not directly turn content not entered into the Rule-Chain into new rules."}]},"rule_refs":["19-two_stage_battery_sharing::v141-c-R002","19-two_stage_battery_sharing::v141-c-R003","19-two_stage_battery_sharing::v141-c-R004","19-two_stage_battery_sharing::v141-c-R006"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-7f5e3dcddfa1014c","COMP-dfd0de19f78ef557","KG31-fc19e7c39ea9de54","KG40-e988fed52eadab03","KG40-f19328f0aeb3d626"]});
